# Start: a fresh Europe base. Purchase a ship (P menu, third row, confirm), pick it by its icon in the Loading box and sail it.
# A ship click opens the ship menu (FUN_38fd_2bfe, @EUROPESHIPOPTIONS), and S / Enter do too: row 2 "Set sail for the New World"
# raises the @SAILAWAY Yes/No (Yes = first row). Ship icon x 172, y 152; menu rows 11 px apart from y 91 (no cargo: row 3 is No changes).
key e                    # open the European Status screen
key p                    # Purchase menu
key Down
key Down
key Return               # third row (a ship)
key Return               # confirm @REALLYBUY
click 172 152            # the new ship's icon: its menu opens
key Escape               # no change
key s                    # S opens the menu for the selected ship
key Down                 # row 2 Set sail for the New World
key Return               # @SAILAWAY
key Return               # Yes: the ship sails
key Escape               # leave Europe
